{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options:\n\n* **Northwind CRM:** Its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n* **Brightdesk Helpdesk:** A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n* **Calmline:** A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n\n**Recommendation:** Northwind CRM is the strongest fit for most teams; Brightdesk is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fd-7719-948a-76b43237e62c","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0046,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:13.000Z","engine":"gemini","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["support software reporting csat","help desk reporting comparison"],"latency_ms":5430,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[127,140],[410,423]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[216,226],[461,471]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[308,316]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."}],"model":"gemini-3.5-f